sequenceDiagram
  participant Odoo as Odoo Process
  participant Handler
  participant Endpoint
  participant Delivery
  participant Queue
  participant API as External API

  Odoo->>Handler: Trigger outbound hook
  Handler->>Endpoint: Resolve endpoint + context
  Handler->>Delivery: Create delivery record
  Handler->>Queue: Enqueue send job
  alt Delivery succeeds (2xx)
    Queue->>API: Send request
    API-->>Queue: 2xx response
    Queue->>Delivery: Mark done + log
    Queue->>Handler: Notify response hook
  else Retryable (5xx / timeout)
    Queue->>API: Send request
    API-->>Queue: 5xx / timeout
    Queue->>Delivery: Log attempt
    Queue->>Queue: Reschedule (exponential backoff)
    note over Queue,API: Retries up to queue_job max_retries
  else Permanent failure
    Queue->>Delivery: Mark dead-letter
  end
